### Crear un Sport
# @name createSport
POST http://localhost:3000/api/sports
Content-Type: application/json

{
    "name": "Voley"
}

### ID del sport
@sportId = {{createSport.response.body.data.id}}


### Crear un Course para ese sport
# @name createCourse
POST http://localhost:3000/api/courses
Content-Type: application/json

{
    "course_no": 201,
    "sched": "Sabados 10:00hs",
    "professor": "Diego Torres",
    "start_date": "2026-03-01",
    "finish_date": "2026-12-15",
    "quota": 12,
    "sport": {{sportId}}
}

### ID del course
@courseId = {{createCourse.response.body.data.id}}


### Crear un Client
# @name createClient
POST http://localhost:3000/api/clients
Content-Type: application/json

{
    "name": "Emiliano",
    "surname": "Martinez",
    "email": "dibu@mail.com",
    "doc": "*doc*",
    "type_doc": "DNI",
    "password": "*dibu1*",
    "birth_date": "1992-09-02",
    "type_user": "Socio"
}

### ID del client
@clientId = {{createClient.response.body.data.id}}


### Get All (sin filtro)
GET http://localhost:3000/api/inscriptions


###POST — inscribir al cliente en el curso
# @name createInscription
POST http://localhost:3000/api/inscriptions
Content-Type: application/json

{
    "course": {{courseId}},
    "client": {{clientId}}
}


### Get All filtrado por curso (¿quiénes están anotados a este curso?)
GET http://localhost:3000/api/inscriptions?courseId={{courseId}}


### Get All filtrado por cliente (¿a qué está anotado este cliente?)
GET http://localhost:3000/api/inscriptions?clientId={{clientId}}


### Get One (clave compuesta en la URL)
GET http://localhost:3000/api/inscriptions/{{courseId}}/{{clientId}}


### POST de nuevo, mismo course+client — debería fallar con 409 (ya está inscripto)
POST http://localhost:3000/api/inscriptions
Content-Type: application/json

{
    "course": {{courseId}},
    "client": {{clientId}}
}


### Delete
DELETE http://localhost:3000/api/inscriptions/{{courseId}}/{{clientId}}


### Get One de nuevo — debería devolver 404 (ya se borró)
GET http://localhost:3000/api/inscriptions/{{courseId}}/{{clientId}}